      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>In trying to reproduce the issue described in this ticket, I perform the following steps:<br/>\n1. Create basic container<br/>\n$ curl -i -XPUT -H'Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"' -H\"Content-type: text/turtle\" --data-binary @body.rdf localhost:8080/rest/box</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Where body.rdf is:<br/>\n```<br/>\n&lt;&gt; &lt;<a href=\"http://awoods.com#title\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://awoods.com#title</a>&gt; \"A title\"<br/>\n```</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>2. Verify the user-triple was created<br/>\n$ curl localhost:8080/rest/box</p>\n\n<p>3. Update the container with a new triple<br/>\n$ curl -i -XPATCH -H\"Content-type: application/sparql-update\" --data-binary @update.su localhost:8080/rest/box</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Where update.su is:<br/>\n```<br/>\nINSERT \n{ &lt;&gt; &lt;http://awoods.com#relation&gt; &lt;http://localhost:8080/rest/someOtherResource&gt; }\n<p> WHERE {}<br/>\n```</p></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>4. Verify the triple was inserted<br/>\n$ curl localhost:8080/rest/box</p>\n\n<p>..all is well. Should the test be different to demonstrate the issue?</p>\n\n",
     "created": "08/Sep/20 12:49 PM",
     "id": "21414",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13239/comment/21414",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
