  "description": "<p>When PATCHing with a statement like</p>\n\n<p><font color=\"#6a8759\">prefix ldp: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#</a>&gt;</font><br/>\n<font color=\"#6a8759\">DELETE { &lt;&gt; ldp:membershipResource ?o }</font><br/>\n<font color=\"#6a8759\">INSERT { &lt;&gt; ldp:membershipResource &lt;/rest/someResource</font><font color=\"#6a8759\">&gt; }</font><br/>\n<font color=\"#6a8759\">WHERE { &lt;&gt; ldp:membershipResource ?o }</font></p>\n\n<p><font color=\"#172b4d\">The final graph contains</font></p>\n\n<p><font color=\"#172b4d\">(triple &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:59512/rest/f7407624-da02-4617-acca-3b5d30e3a70b/322fd97b-3b0d-4237-86f2-9ff98ce86b85\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:59512/rest/f7407624-da02-4617-acca-3b5d30e3a70b/322fd97b-3b0d-4237-86f2-9ff98ce86b85</a>&gt; &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#membershipResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#membershipResource</a>&gt; &lt;info:/rest/someResource&gt;)</font></p>\n\n<p><font color=\"#172b4d\">There is soon to be code in the HttpIdentifierConverter to account for these as external Ids and correctly convert them to internal IDs.</font></p>",
